{"id":"level-up-2026-09-17","name":"2026-09-17 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s51","en":"A fallen tree brought traffic to a halt this morning.","zh":"今早，一棵倒下的树让交通陷入停顿。","note":"halt · 暂停；踌躇； · bring to a halt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s52","en":"We left the café after seeing its exorbitant prices.","zh":"看到价格贵得离谱，我们离开了那家咖啡馆。","note":"exorbitant · 过分的， 不合理的 · exorbitant prices","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s53","en":"My neighbour is recovering from surgery and appreciates our weekly visits.","zh":"我的邻居正在术后恢复，很感谢我们每周去探望。","note":"surgery · 外科学； 外科手术； 手术室， 诊疗室 · recover from surgery","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s54","en":"A violent storm damaged several fishing boats along the coast.","zh":"一场猛烈的风暴损坏了沿岸的几艘渔船。","note":"violent · 暴力的； 带有强烈感情的； 猛烈的 · a violent storm","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s55","en":"The two neighbours met to resolve their dispute over parking.","zh":"两位邻居见面解决停车方面的争执。","note":"resolve · 解决，解答；决定，决意；分解，分析；决心， 决意 · resolve a dispute","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s56","en":"The village must confront the challenge of an ageing population.","zh":"这个村庄必须面对人口老龄化的挑战。","note":"confront · 遭遇； 面对， 正视 · confront a challenge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s57","en":"The charity will deploy extra volunteers during the winter food drive.","zh":"冬季食品募捐期间，慈善机构将增派志愿者。","note":"deploy · 部署； 使用， 运用 · deploy resources","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s58","en":"Another laboratory was able to reproduce the original experiment's results.","zh":"另一家实验室成功复现了原实验的结果。","note":"reproduce · 繁殖， 生育； 复制， 仿造， 翻版； 再现， 使…在脑海中重现 · reproduce a result","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s59","en":"The hikers began to huddle together as the temperature dropped.","zh":"气温下降时，徒步者们开始挤在一起取暖。","note":"huddle · 聚集在一起；杂乱的一堆； 拥挤 · huddle together","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s60","en":"Her moving rendition of the folk song silenced the crowded room.","zh":"她动人的民歌演唱让拥挤的房间安静下来。","note":"rendition · 表演， 扮演， 演唱； 翻译； 视觉再现 · a moving rendition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s61","en":"Turn left at the busy intersection just beyond the supermarket.","zh":"过了超市后，在那个繁忙的十字路口左转。","note":"intersection · 道路交叉口， 十字路口 · a busy intersection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s62","en":"Leo won a scholarship that covered most of his tuition fees.","zh":"利奥获得了一笔支付大部分学费的奖学金。","note":"scholarship · 奖学金； 学问， 学识 · win a scholarship","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s63","en":"The flat is too expensive; besides, it is far from work.","zh":"这套公寓太贵了，而且离上班的地方很远。","note":"besides · 除此之外，而且 · besides that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s64","en":"Regular encouragement can instil confidence in children learning to read.","zh":"经常鼓励可以培养正在学阅读的孩子的信心。","note":"instil · 滴注； 逐渐灌输； 逐步培养 · instil confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s65","en":"The warehouse has a separate storage area for inflammable materials.","zh":"仓库设有易燃材料的独立存放区。","note":"inflammable · 易燃的； 易怒的 · inflammable materials","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s66","en":"The university will implement its new recycling policy next term.","zh":"大学将于下学期实施新的回收政策。","note":"implement · 使生效，实施；贯彻，执行['ImplImənt]；工具 · implement a policy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s67","en":"Local farmers export fresh fruit to several neighbouring countries.","zh":"当地农民向几个邻国出口新鲜水果。","note":"export · 出口；输出，传播['3kspɔːt]；出口； 输出； 出口商品 · export goods","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s68","en":"The school survey asked students about their emotional well-being.","zh":"学校调查询问了学生的情绪健康状况。","note":"well-being · 安宁； 福利 · emotional well-being","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s69","en":"The report compares plants that incinerate waste with recycling facilities.","zh":"这份报告比较了垃圾焚烧厂与回收设施。","note":"incinerate · 焚化， 焚毁， 把…烧成灰烬 · incinerate waste","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s70","en":"Her fantasy novel follows a young sailor across imaginary oceans.","zh":"她的奇幻小说讲述一名年轻水手穿越虚构海洋的故事。","note":"fantasy · 想象 · a fantasy novel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s71","en":"Repeated delays began to erode public confidence in the project.","zh":"一再拖延开始削弱公众对该项目的信心。","note":"erode · 侵蚀， 腐蚀； 削弱， 损害 · erode confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s72","en":"Please check the details before you submit your application.","zh":"提交申请前，请核对各项信息。","note":"check · 检查，核对；阻止， · check the details","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s73","en":"Unreliable internet connections continue to frustrate our efforts to teach online.","zh":"不稳定的网络连接持续阻碍我们开展线上教学。","note":"frustrate · 使沮丧； 挫败 · frustrate one's efforts","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s74","en":"The bedroom window offers a gorgeous view of the harbour.","zh":"从卧室窗户可以看到港口的美丽景色。","note":"gorgeous · 华丽的； 极好的 · a gorgeous view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s75","en":"We chose a pragmatic solution that fitted our limited budget.","zh":"我们选择了一个符合有限预算的务实方案。","note":"pragmatic · 务实的； 实事求是的； 实用主义观点的 · a pragmatic solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s76","en":"The researchers measured methane emissions from the wetland throughout summer.","zh":"研究人员整个夏季都在测量该湿地的甲烷排放。","note":"methane · 甲烷， 沼气 · methane emissions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s77","en":"Planting trees on the hillside helped reduce soil erosion.","zh":"在山坡上种树有助于减少土壤侵蚀。","note":"erosion · 腐蚀； 磨损 · soil erosion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s78","en":"Visitors ascend a steep staircase to reach the viewing platform.","zh":"游客登上一段陡峭的楼梯，到达观景平台。","note":"ascend · 攀登； 上升， 升高 · ascend a staircase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s79","en":"My superstitious uncle always carries a lucky coin when travelling.","zh":"我迷信的叔叔旅行时总带着一枚幸运硬币。","note":"superstitious · 迷信的； 根据迷信的， 由迷信引起的； 受迷信思想支配的 · superstitious beliefs","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s80","en":"The company decided to reorient its strategy towards local customers.","zh":"公司决定调整策略，转向本地客户。","note":"reorient · 重新定方位； 重新定位； 使适应 · reorient a strategy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s81","en":"You may borrow my bicycle provided that you return it tonight.","zh":"只要今晚归还，你就可以借我的自行车。","note":"provided · 倘若， 只要， 假如 · provided that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s82","en":"A reliable map is an indispensable tool on remote hiking routes.","zh":"在偏远徒步路线上，一张可靠的地图是必不可少的工具。","note":"indispensable · 必不可少的， 必需的 · an indispensable tool","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s83","en":"She cleaned the camera lens before photographing the mountain lake.","zh":"拍摄山间湖泊前，她清洁了相机镜头。","note":"lens · 透镜； 镜片； 镜头 · a camera lens","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s84","en":"The building's simple design aims to embody the school's practical values.","zh":"建筑的简洁设计旨在体现学校务实的价值观。","note":"embody · 表达， 体现； 具体表现， 使具体化； 包括， 包含 · embody a principle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s85","en":"A campus map helps new students orientate themselves during their first week.","zh":"校园地图帮助新生在第一周熟悉方位。","note":"orientate · 使适应， 使熟悉情况； 给…定位， 给…定向； 使朝向； 转至特定方向； 适应 · orientate oneself","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s86","en":"The students compared bacterial growth on two different culture plates.","zh":"学生们比较了两个不同培养皿中的细菌生长情况。","note":"bacterial · 细菌的； 由细菌引起的 · bacterial growth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s87","en":"The detective could find no clear motive for the theft.","zh":"侦探找不到这起盗窃案的明确动机。","note":"motive · 动机， 目的 · a clear motive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s88","en":"We envisage a future in which every village has reliable internet.","zh":"我们设想未来每个村庄都有可靠的网络。","note":"envisage · 展望， 想象； 面对 · envisage a future","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s89","en":"The bakery ordered extra flour in anticipation of the holiday rush.","zh":"面包店预计假期会很忙，额外订购了面粉。","note":"anticipation · 预料 · in anticipation of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s90","en":"Clear feedback can motivate students to revise their work more carefully.","zh":"明确的反馈能激励学生更认真地修改作业。","note":"motivate · 使有动机； 激励， 激发 · motivate students","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s91","en":"The trainer used positive reinforcement to encourage the dog's calm behaviour.","zh":"训练员通过正向强化鼓励狗保持安静。","note":"reinforcement · 增援， 加强， 加固 · positive reinforcement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s92","en":"Our weekly tutorial gives us time to discuss difficult readings.","zh":"每周的辅导课给我们时间讨论难懂的阅读材料。","note":"tutorial · 大学导师的辅导课； · a weekly tutorial","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s93","en":"Please do not spoil the surprise by mentioning the party.","zh":"请别提聚会，以免破坏这份惊喜。","note":"spoil · 损坏，破坏，糟蹋；宠坏，溺爱；变质 · spoil the surprise","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s94","en":"To calculate the total cost, multiply the ticket price by three.","zh":"计算总费用时，把票价乘以三。","note":"multiply · 增加， 繁殖； 乘 · multiply by three","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s95","en":"The farmer moved the sheep to fresh pasture beyond the stream.","zh":"农民把羊赶到溪流那边的新鲜牧场。","note":"pasture · 牧场，草原；放牧 · green pasture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s96","en":"Despite his physical infirmity, the retired teacher remained intellectually curious.","zh":"尽管身体虚弱，这位退休教师仍保持着求知欲。","note":"infirmity · 虚弱， 衰弱 · physical infirmity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s97","en":"The pilot welcomed passengers before the aircraft left the gate.","zh":"飞机离开登机口前，飞行员向乘客致意。","note":"pilot · 飞行员，引航员；驾驶， 为…引航 · an experienced pilot","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s98","en":"The student group must seek approval before using the main hall.","zh":"学生社团使用礼堂前必须申请批准。","note":"approval · 赞成， 同意； 正式批准 · seek approval","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s99","en":"The exhibition explores historical beliefs about the curative properties of plants.","zh":"这个展览探讨了历史上有关植物疗效的观念。","note":"curative · 有疗效的； 医疗的 · curative properties","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:s100","en":"The journalist checked multiple sources before publishing the report.","zh":"记者发表报道前核查了多个信息来源。","note":"multiple · 多重的；多样的；倍数 · multiple sources","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:w51","en":"halt","zh":"暂停；踌躇；","note":"英 /hɔːlt/ · 美 /hɔlt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0051-uk-efaa2a724d04.mp3","text":"halt"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0051-us-cc7a51469fb9.mp3","text":"halt"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:w52","en":"exorbitant","zh":"过分的， 不合理的","note":"英 /ɪg'zɔːbɪtənt/ · 美 /ɪɡ'zɔrbɪtənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0052-uk-b282d7752ecb.mp3","text":"exorbitant"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0052-us-ddcfc3f5ee4a.mp3","text":"exorbitant"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-17:w53","en":"surgery","zh":"外科学； 外科手术； 手术室， 诊疗室","note":"英 /'sɜːdʒəri/ · 美 /'sɝdʒəri/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/lev